{% layout 'theme' %}

{%- comment -%}
  Black Friday per categorie, voor de zoekopdrachten "black friday inbouwspots",
  "black friday led lampen", "black friday wandlampen" enzovoort (Google Autocomplete,
  03-11-2026). Eén template voor alle pagina's; de handle van de pagina bepaalt de
  collectie en de teksten. Aantallen en prijzen komen live uit de collectie, zodat de
  tekst nooit iets belooft wat er niet is. Actiedata staan in page.black-friday.liquid
  en hier; jaarlijks allebei omzetten.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign sw_bf_start = '2026-11-20' -%}
{%- assign sw_bf_end = '2026-11-30' -%}
{%- assign sw_en = false -%}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}{%- assign sw_en = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign sw_root = routes.root_url | append: '/' | replace: '//', '/' | remove_last: '/' -%}

{%- case page.handle -%}
  {%- when 'black-friday-led-lampen' -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'led-lampen' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday LED bulbs: 10% off{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}GU10 LED bulbs, smart Zigbee bulbs and Dim2Warm bulbs that turn warmer as you dim. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Check the fitting first.</strong> Almost all bulbs in this range are GU10; a few are G9, MR11 or E27. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-een-gu10-fitting">What is a GU10 fitting?</a></li><li><strong>Dimmable or not.</strong> Most bulbs here are dimmable on a trailing edge (triac) dimmer. The Tresso dims in three steps with your normal switch.</li><li><strong>Warm or warmer.</strong> 2700K is cosy, 3000K slightly fresher. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-het-verschil-tussen-2700k-en-3000k">2700K or 3000K?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Which LED bulb replaces a 50 W halogen spot?</summary><p>A GU10 LED bulb of about 5 to 7 W with 350 to 500 lumen. The lumen figure is on every product in this collection.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have smart bulbs?</summary><p>Yes, the Zigo and Chromo bulbs work over Zigbee, the Chromo is also available on 2.4 GHz.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday led lampen: 10% korting{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}GU10-ledlampen, slimme Zigbee-lampen en Dim2Warm-lampen die warmer worden als je dimt. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Kijk eerst naar de fitting.</strong> Bijna alle lampen in deze collectie zijn GU10; een paar zijn G9, MR11 of E27. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-een-gu10-fitting">Wat is een GU10-fitting?</a></li><li><strong>Dimbaar of niet.</strong> De meeste lampen hier zijn dimbaar op een fase-afsnijdingsdimmer (triac). De Tresso dimt in drie standen met je gewone schakelaar.</li><li><strong>Warm of warmer.</strong> 2700K is knus, 3000K net iets frisser. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-het-verschil-tussen-2700k-en-3000k">2700K of 3000K?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Welke led lamp vervangt een halogeenspot van 50 watt?</summary><p>Een GU10-ledlamp van ongeveer 5 tot 7 watt met 350 tot 500 lumen. Het aantal lumen staat bij elk product in deze collectie.</p></details><details><summary>Hebben jullie slimme lampen?</summary><p>Ja, de Zigo- en Chromo-lampen werken via Zigbee, de Chromo is er ook op 2,4 GHz.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'black-friday-wandlampen' -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'wandlampen' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday wall lights: 10% off{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Up &amp; down wall lights, outdoor wall lights up to IP65 and a rechargeable wall light that needs no wiring. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Indoor or outdoor.</strong> Outdoors you need at least IP44; IP20 is for indoors only. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/mag-een-ip44-lamp-buiten-hangen">Can an IP44 light hang outside?</a></li><li><strong>Bulb included or not.</strong> COB wall lights have built-in LEDs; GU10 and G9 models need a separate bulb.</li><li><strong>No connection point?</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wandlamp-zonder-lichtpunt-welke-opties-heb-je">Wall light without a connection point: your options</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Do you have wall lights with a motion sensor?</summary><p>Yes, the Senso has a built-in motion sensor.</p></details><details><summary>How do I connect a wall light?</summary><p>Step by step in <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-sluit-je-een-wandlamp-aan">How do you connect a wall light?</a></p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday wandlampen: 10% korting{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Up &amp; down wandlampen, buitenwandlampen tot IP65 en een oplaadbare wandlamp zonder bedrading. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Binnen of buiten.</strong> Buiten heb je minimaal IP44 nodig; IP20 is alleen voor binnen. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/mag-een-ip44-lamp-buiten-hangen">Mag een IP44-lamp buiten hangen?</a></li><li><strong>Lamp erbij of niet.</strong> COB-wandlampen hebben ingebouwde led; GU10- en G9-modellen hebben een losse lamp nodig.</li><li><strong>Geen lichtpunt op de muur?</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wandlamp-zonder-lichtpunt-welke-opties-heb-je">Wandlamp zonder lichtpunt: welke opties heb je?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Hebben jullie wandlampen met bewegingssensor?</summary><p>Ja, de Senso heeft een ingebouwde bewegingssensor.</p></details><details><summary>Hoe sluit ik een wandlamp aan?</summary><p>Stap voor stap in <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-sluit-je-een-wandlamp-aan">Hoe sluit je een wandlamp aan?</a></p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'black-friday-buitenverlichting' -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'inbouwspots-buiten' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday outdoor lighting: 10% off{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}IP65 recessed spots for canopies, porches and soffits, including a spot with a motion sensor and complete sets with remote control. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>IP44 or IP65.</strong> Under a canopy IP44 is enough, where rain can reach the spot choose IP65. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-het-verschil-tussen-ip44-en-ip65">IP44 versus IP65</a></li><li><strong>How much light.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-lumen-heb-je-nodig-voor-buitenverlichting">How many lumens for outdoor lighting?</a></li><li><strong>Wall lights for outside</strong> are in the <a href="{{ sw_root }}/pages/black-friday-wandlampen">Black Friday wall lights</a>.</li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Do you have an outdoor spot with a motion sensor?</summary><p>Yes, the Movo recessed spot has a built-in motion sensor and is IP65.</p></details><details><summary>Can I dim outdoor spots?</summary><p>Many of them, yes. Which ones is stated per product.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday buitenverlichting: 10% korting{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}IP65-inbouwspots voor overkapping, veranda en dakgoot, met een spot met bewegingssensor en complete sets met afstandsbediening. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>IP44 of IP65.</strong> Onder een overkapping is IP44 genoeg, waar regen bij de spot komt kies je IP65. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/wat-is-het-verschil-tussen-ip44-en-ip65">IP44 tegenover IP65</a></li><li><strong>Hoeveel licht.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-lumen-heb-je-nodig-voor-buitenverlichting">Hoeveel lumen heb je nodig voor buitenverlichting?</a></li><li><strong>Wandlampen voor buiten</strong> staan bij <a href="{{ sw_root }}/pages/black-friday-wandlampen">Black Friday wandlampen</a>.</li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Hebben jullie een buitenspot met bewegingssensor?</summary><p>Ja, de Movo-inbouwspot heeft een ingebouwde bewegingssensor en is IP65.</p></details><details><summary>Kan ik buitenspots dimmen?</summary><p>Veel wel. Welke staat per product vermeld.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'black-friday-railverlichting' -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'railverlichting' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday track lighting: 10% off{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}1-phase track for the home, 3-phase track for shops and offices, with track spots, light bars, pendants and all parts. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>1-phase or 3-phase.</strong> Spots and track must match; a 3-phase spot does not fit a 1-phase track.</li><li><strong>Track length and power supply.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-meter-rail-en-welke-voeding-heb-je-nodig">How much track and which power supply?</a></li><li><strong>Connectors.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-3-fase-rail-connector-heb-je-nodig">Which 3-phase connector do you need?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Do you have track spots with high colour rendering?</summary><p>Yes, several 3-phase spots have a CRI above 90; it is stated per product.</p></details><details><summary>How do I mount a 1-phase track?</summary><p>See <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-monteer-je-een-1-fase-rail">How do you mount a 1-phase track?</a></p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday railverlichting: 10% korting{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}1-fase rail voor thuis, 3-fase rail voor winkel en kantoor, met railspots, lichtbalken, hanglampen en alle onderdelen. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>1-fase of 3-fase.</strong> Spot en rail moeten bij elkaar passen; een 3-fase spot past niet op een 1-fase rail.</li><li><strong>Lengte en voeding.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-meter-rail-en-welke-voeding-heb-je-nodig">Hoeveel meter rail en welke voeding heb je nodig?</a></li><li><strong>Verbinders.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-3-fase-rail-connector-heb-je-nodig">Welke 3-fase rail connector heb je nodig?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Hebben jullie railspots met een hoge kleurweergave?</summary><p>Ja, meerdere 3-fase spots hebben een CRI boven de 90; dat staat per product vermeld.</p></details><details><summary>Hoe monteer ik een 1-fase rail?</summary><p>Zie <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-monteer-je-een-1-fase-rail">Hoe monteer je een 1-fase rail?</a></p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- when 'black-friday-hanglampen' -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'hanglampen' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday pendant lights: 10% off{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Pendant lights for above the dining table, with adjustable height, and pendants that hang straight from a 1-phase or 3-phase track. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Height above the table.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-hoog-hang-je-een-lamp-boven-de-eettafel">How high do you hang a lamp above the dining table?</a></li><li><strong>On a track.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/kun-je-een-hanglamp-aan-een-railsysteem-hangen">Can you hang a pendant on a track?</a></li><li><strong>Connecting.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-sluit-je-een-hanglamp-aan">How do you connect a pendant light?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Is the bulb included?</summary><p>That differs per lamp: GU10 and E27 models need a separate bulb, integrated LED models do not. It is stated per product.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday hanglampen: 10% korting{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Hanglampen voor boven de eettafel, met verstelbare hoogte, en hanglampen die direct aan een 1-fase of 3-fase rail hangen. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Hoogte boven de tafel.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-hoog-hang-je-een-lamp-boven-de-eettafel">Hoe hoog hang je een lamp boven de eettafel?</a></li><li><strong>Aan een rail.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/kun-je-een-hanglamp-aan-een-railsysteem-hangen">Kun je een hanglamp aan een railsysteem hangen?</a></li><li><strong>Aansluiten.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoe-sluit-je-een-hanglamp-aan">Hoe sluit je een hanglamp aan?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Zit de lamp erbij?</summary><p>Dat verschilt per hanglamp: GU10- en E27-modellen hebben een losse lamp nodig, modellen met ingebouwde led niet. Het staat per product vermeld.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign sw_col = 'inbouwspots' -%}
    {%- if sw_en -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday recessed spotlights: 10% off LED spots{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Dimmable LED recessed spots, IP65 spots for bathroom and outdoors, Dim2Warm spots and complete sets with remote control. From 20 to 30 November 10% comes off automatically in your cart.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Cut-out size.</strong> Measure the hole before you buy. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-zaagmaat-heb-je-nodig-voor-inbouwspots">Which cut-out size do you need?</a></li><li><strong>Recess depth.</strong> Spots with integrated LED need much less depth than a GU10 set-up. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-inbouwdiepte-heb-je-nodig-voor-een-inbouwspot">How much recess depth do you need?</a></li><li><strong>Dimmer.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-led-dimmer-heb-je-nodig-voor-je-spots">Which LED dimmer do you need?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Which spots are suitable for the bathroom?</summary><p>The IP65 spots, such as Lesto, Lyvo, Cielo and Ferro. See <a href="{{ sw_root }}/collections/inbouwspots-badkamer">bathroom recessed spots</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Do you sell spots per set?</summary><p>Yes, the Dovo set comes in 6 and 10 pieces, with remote control.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture sw_h1 -%}Black Friday inbouwspots: 10% korting op led spots{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_lead -%}Dimbare led inbouwspots, IP65-spots voor badkamer en buiten, Dim2Warm-spots en complete sets met afstandsbediening. Van 20 tot en met 30 november gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen.{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_tips -%}<li><strong>Zaagmaat.</strong> Meet het gat voordat je koopt. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-zaagmaat-heb-je-nodig-voor-inbouwspots">Welke zaagmaat heb je nodig?</a></li><li><strong>Inbouwdiepte.</strong> Spots met vaste led vragen veel minder diepte dan een GU10-opstelling. <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/hoeveel-inbouwdiepte-heb-je-nodig-voor-een-inbouwspot">Hoeveel inbouwdiepte heb je nodig?</a></li><li><strong>Dimmer.</strong> <a href="{{ sw_root }}/blogs/kennisbank/welke-led-dimmer-heb-je-nodig-voor-je-spots">Welke led-dimmer heb je nodig?</a></li>{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture sw_faq -%}<details><summary>Welke spots zijn geschikt voor de badkamer?</summary><p>De IP65-spots, zoals Lesto, Lyvo, Cielo en Ferro. Zie <a href="{{ sw_root }}/collections/inbouwspots-badkamer">inbouwspots voor de badkamer</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Verkopen jullie spots per set?</summary><p>Ja, de Dovo-set is er in 6 en 10 stuks, met afstandsbediening.</p></details>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endcase -%}

{%- assign c = collections[sw_col] -%}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {% if sw_en %}"Do I need a discount code?"{% else %}"Heb ik een kortingscode nodig?"{% endif %},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {% if sw_en %}"No. From 20 to 30 November 2026 10% comes off automatically in your cart."{% else %}"Nee. Van 20 tot en met 30 november 2026 gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen."{% endif %} }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<style>
.sw-bf{--sw-ink:#12181f;--sw-body:#414a55;--sw-muted:#767f8b;--sw-rule:#e2e5e9;--sw-fill:#f7f8f9;--sw-accent:#0a3a72;background:#fff;color:var(--sw-body)}
.sw-bf-wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 1rem 4rem}
@media(min-width:768px){.sw-bf-wrap{padding:3rem 1.5rem 4.5rem}}
.sw-bf-hero{background:var(--sw-ink);color:#fff}
.sw-bf-hero .sw-bf-wrap{padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:2.5rem}
.sw-bf-kicker{font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a7aeb6;margin:0 0 .875rem}
.sw-bf-kicker a{color:#a7aeb6}
.sw-bf-hero h1{font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.625rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;color:#fff;max-width:44rem}
.sw-bf-lead{font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:#c9cfd6;margin:0 0 1.25rem;max-width:42rem}
.sw-bf-status{display:inline-block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;padding:.375rem .75rem;border:1px solid #3a434e;color:#fff;margin:0}
.sw-bf-status:empty{display:none}
.sw-bf h2{font-size:1.375rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--sw-ink);letter-spacing:-.012em;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 1rem}
.sw-bf-tips{max-width:44rem;margin:0 0 0;padding-left:1.25rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}
.sw-bf-tips li{margin-bottom:.625rem}
.sw-bf-tips strong{color:var(--sw-ink)}
.sw-bf a{color:var(--sw-accent)}
.sw-bf-sub{margin:0 0 1.5rem;font-size:.9688rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:42rem}
.sw-bf-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}
@media(min-width:768px){.sw-bf-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem}}
@media(min-width:1024px){.sw-bf-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}
.sw-bf-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--sw-rule);background:#fff;transition:border-color .15s}
.sw-bf-card:hover{border-color:#b9c0c8}
.sw-bf .sw-bf-card{color:inherit}
.sw-bf-card-img{aspect-ratio:1/1;background:var(--sw-fill);overflow:hidden}
.sw-bf-card-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.sw-bf-card-body{padding:.75rem .875rem .875rem}
.sw-bf-card-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--sw-ink);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.35;margin:0}
.sw-bf-card-price{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--sw-ink);margin:.375rem 0 0}
.sw-bf-card-price s{color:var(--sw-muted);margin-right:.25rem}
.sw-bf-during{display:none}
.sw-bf.is-live .sw-bf-during{display:inline}
.sw-bf.is-live .sw-bf-before{display:none}
.sw-bf-more{margin:1.5rem 0 0}
.sw-bf-btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--sw-ink);color:#fff !important;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:.875rem 1.5rem;font-size:.9375rem}
.sw-bf-section{border-top:1px solid var(--sw-rule)}
.sw-bf-faq{max-width:44rem}
.sw-bf-faq details{border-top:1px solid var(--sw-rule);padding:1rem 0}
.sw-bf-faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--sw-rule)}
.sw-bf-faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--sw-ink);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.sw-bf-faq details p{margin:.625rem 0 0;font-size:.9688rem;line-height:1.65}
.sw-bf-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.25rem;font-size:.9375rem}
</style>

<div class="sw-bf" id="sw-bf" data-start="{{ sw_bf_start }}" data-end="{{ sw_bf_end }}">
  <section class="sw-bf-hero">
    <div class="sw-bf-wrap">
      <p class="sw-bf-kicker"><a href="{{ sw_root }}/pages/black-friday">Black Friday 2026</a></p>
      <h1>{{ sw_h1 }}</h1>
      <p class="sw-bf-lead">{{ sw_lead }}</p>
      <p class="sw-bf-status" id="sw-bf-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- if c != blank and c.products_count > 0 -%}
  <section>
    <div class="sw-bf-wrap">
      <h2>{{ c.title }}: {{ c.products_count }} {% if sw_en %}products{% else %}producten{% endif %}</h2>
      <p class="sw-bf-sub">
        <span class="sw-bf-before">{% if sw_en %}These are the current prices. During the promotion 10% comes off in your cart, also on products that are already reduced.{% else %}Dit zijn de huidige prijzen. Tijdens de actie gaat er in de winkelwagen 10% vanaf, ook op producten die al afgeprijsd zijn.{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="sw-bf-during">{% if sw_en %}Struck-through is the normal price, next to it what you pay with 10% off.{% else %}Doorgestreept is de normale prijs, ernaast wat je betaalt met 10% korting.{% endif %}</span>
      </p>
      <div class="sw-bf-grid">
        {%- assign sw_n = 0 -%}
        {%- for p in c.products limit: 50 -%}
          {%- if p.available == false -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign sw_n = sw_n | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- if sw_n > 12 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign sw_bf_price = p.price_min | times: 90 | divided_by: 100 -%}
          <a class="sw-bf-card" href="{{ p.url }}">
            <div class="sw-bf-card-img">{%- if p.featured_image -%}{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: p.title }}{%- endif -%}</div>
            <div class="sw-bf-card-body">
              <p class="sw-bf-card-title">{{ p.title | split: ' | ' | first }}</p>
              <p class="sw-bf-card-price">
                {%- assign sw_van = '' -%}{%- if p.price_varies -%}{%- if sw_en -%}{%- assign sw_van = 'from ' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sw_van = 'vanaf ' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
                <span class="sw-bf-before">{{ sw_van }}{{ p.price_min | money }}</span>
                <span class="sw-bf-during">{{ sw_van }}<s>{{ p.price_min | money }}</s>{{ sw_bf_price | money }}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <p class="sw-bf-more"><a class="sw-bf-btn" href="{{ c.url }}">{% if sw_en %}View all {{ c.products_count }} products{% else %}Bekijk alle {{ c.products_count }} producten{% endif %}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  <section class="sw-bf-section">
    <div class="sw-bf-wrap">
      <h2>{% if sw_en %}Before you buy{% else %}Waar let je op{% endif %}</h2>
      <ul class="sw-bf-tips">{{ sw_tips }}</ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sw-bf-section">
    <div class="sw-bf-wrap">
      <h2>{% if sw_en %}Frequently asked questions{% else %}Veelgestelde vragen{% endif %}</h2>
      <div class="sw-bf-faq">
        {{ sw_faq }}
        {% if sw_en %}
        <details><summary>Do I need a discount code?</summary><p>No. From 20 to 30 November 2026 10% comes off automatically in your cart. Free shipping from €50, 14 days to return.</p></details>
        {% else %}
        <details><summary>Heb ik een kortingscode nodig?</summary><p>Nee. Van 20 tot en met 30 november 2026 gaat er automatisch 10% af in je winkelwagen. Gratis verzending vanaf €50, 14 dagen retourrecht.</p></details>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sw-bf-section">
    <div class="sw-bf-wrap">
      <h2>{% if sw_en %}More Black Friday{% else %}Meer Black Friday{% endif %}</h2>
      <div class="sw-bf-links">
        <a href="{{ sw_root }}/pages/black-friday">{% if sw_en %}All Black Friday offers{% else %}Alle Black Friday-aanbiedingen{% endif %}</a>
        {%- assign sw_alle = 'black-friday-inbouwspots,black-friday-led-lampen,black-friday-wandlampen,black-friday-buitenverlichting,black-friday-railverlichting,black-friday-hanglampen' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- for h in sw_alle -%}
          {%- if h == page.handle -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign sw_p = pages[h] -%}
          {%- if sw_p != blank -%}<a href="{{ sw_root }}/pages/{{ h }}">{{ sw_p.title }}</a>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var el = document.getElementById('sw-bf'); if (!el) return;
  var out = document.getElementById('sw-bf-status');
  var en = {{ sw_en | json }};
  var start = new Date(el.dataset.start + 'T00:00:00+01:00');
  var end = new Date(el.dataset.end + 'T23:59:59+01:00');
  var now = new Date();
  if (now >= start && now <= end) {
    el.classList.add('is-live');
    var left = Math.ceil((end - now) / 864e5);
    out.textContent = en ? ('On now, ' + (left > 1 ? left + ' days left' : 'last day')) : ('Loopt nu, ' + (left > 1 ? 'nog ' + left + ' dagen' : 'laatste dag'));
  } else if (now < start) {
    var d = Math.ceil((start - now) / 864e5);
    out.textContent = en ? ('Starts in ' + d + (d === 1 ? ' day' : ' days')) : ('Start over ' + d + (d === 1 ? ' dag' : ' dagen'));
  } else {
    out.textContent = en ? 'This promotion has ended' : 'Deze actie is afgelopen';
  }
})();
</script>
